# Build artifacts
target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Nix build outputs (dangling store symlinks; must never enter the context)
result
result-*

# direnv cache: filenames embed a per-eval env hash, so leaving this in the
# context rotates the content-addressed image tag on every `direnv reload`.
.direnv/
.envrc

# VCS / CI
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Misc
**/*.log

# [zero] Docs never feed the zainod build (no crate include_str!'s markdown),
# so doc-only changes must not invalidate the COPY layer and force a full
# dependency recompile. live-tests/ stays included: its members are part of
# the root workspace manifest, which cargo install resolves.
docs/
**/*.md


